{"seq":2,"slug":"test-reporting-analytics","title":"测试报告与分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/e2e-test-automation/ci-integration/test-reporting-analytics","wordCount":1290,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"测试报告与分析\">测试报告与分析</h1><p>测试报告不仅仅是&quot;通过/失败&quot;的列表——它是将原始测试运行数据转化为可行动决策的分析系统。好的报告系统能回答&quot;哪里出了问题&quot;、&quot;问题的严重程度如何&quot;、&quot;趋势是在好转还是恶化&quot;，进而驱动工程改进。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>分层报告</strong>：不同角色（开发者/QA Lead/经理）需要不同粒度的报告，从详细 Trace 到趋势指标</li>\n<li><strong>Trace Viewer</strong>：Playwright 的交互式调试工具，可逐帧回放失败测试的每一步操作和 DOM 状态</li>\n<li><strong>失败归因</strong>：自动将测试失败分类为回归 Bug、Flaky、环境问题或测试本身问题</li>\n<li><strong>趋势分析</strong>：追踪通过率、Flaky 率、执行时间等指标的周级趋势，发现渐进式退化</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"报告层级模型\">报告层级模型</h2><p>不同角色需要不同粒度的报告：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>角色</th>\n<th>关注点</th>\n<th>报告形式</th>\n<th>刷新频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>开发者</td>\n<td>我的 PR 哪个测试失败了、为什么</td>\n<td>HTML 报告 + Trace</td>\n<td>每次 CI 运行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>QA Lead</td>\n<td>套件整体健康度、Flaky 趋势</td>\n<td>仪表板</td>\n<td>每日</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工程经理</td>\n<td>测试覆盖率、回归发现率</td>\n<td>周报摘要</td>\n<td>每周</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VP/CTO</td>\n<td>质量趋势、发布信心指数</td>\n<td>指标卡片</td>\n<td>每月</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[CI 运行原始数据] --&gt; B[结果解析]&#10;    B --&gt; C[开发者报告: 失败详情+Trace]&#10;    B --&gt; D[趋势分析: Flaky/通过率/耗时]&#10;    B --&gt; E[覆盖度量: 场景覆盖率]&#10;    C --&gt; F[PR 评论 / Slack 通知]&#10;    D --&gt; G[仪表板 / 周报]&#10;    E --&gt; H[覆盖率趋势图]\">graph TD\n    A[CI 运行原始数据] --&gt; B[结果解析]\n    B --&gt; C[开发者报告: 失败详情+Trace]\n    B --&gt; D[趋势分析: Flaky/通过率/耗时]\n    B --&gt; E[覆盖度量: 场景覆盖率]\n    C --&gt; F[PR 评论 / Slack 通知]\n    D --&gt; G[仪表板 / 周报]\n    E --&gt; H[覆盖率趋势图]</pre><h2 id=\"playwright-内置报告\">Playwright 内置报告</h2><h3 id=\"报告器类型\">报告器类型</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>报告器</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>html</code></td>\n<td>交互式 HTML 页面</td>\n<td>本地调试、CI 产物分享</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>json</code></td>\n<td>JSON 结构化数据</td>\n<td>自定义分析和集成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>junit</code></td>\n<td>JUnit XML</td>\n<td>CI 平台原生展示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>dot</code></td>\n<td>终端点状进度</td>\n<td>快速 CI 输出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>list</code></td>\n<td>终端列表</td>\n<td>本地开发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>blob</code></td>\n<td>二进制 blob</td>\n<td>分片合并</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"多报告器并行配置\">多报告器并行配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// playwright.config.ts&#10;export default defineConfig({&#10;  reporter: [&#10;    // 本地开发：终端输出&#10;    [&#39;list&#39;],&#10;    // CI 集成：JUnit 格式&#10;    [&#39;junit&#39;, { outputFile: &#39;results/junit.xml&#39; }],&#10;    // 详细调试：HTML 报告&#10;    [&#39;html&#39;, { open: &#39;never&#39;, outputFolder: &#39;playwright-report&#39; }],&#10;    // 数据分析：JSON 原始数据&#10;    [&#39;json&#39;, { outputFile: &#39;results/results.json&#39; }],&#10;  ],&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// playwright.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reporter: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 本地开发：终端输出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'list'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // CI 集成：JUnit 格式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'junit'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { outputFile: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'results/junit.xml'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 详细调试：HTML 报告</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'html'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { open: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'never'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, outputFolder: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'playwright-report'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 数据分析：JSON 原始数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'json'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { outputFile: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'results/results.json'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"html-报告内容\">HTML 报告内容</h3><p>Playwright 的 HTML 报告包含：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>测试结果汇总（通过/失败/跳过/Flaky）</li>\n<li>每个失败测试的详细错误信息</li>\n<li>内嵌 Trace Viewer（可逐帧回放）</li>\n<li>截图和视频附件</li>\n<li>执行时间分布</li>\n<li>重试历史</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"关键度量指标\">关键度量指标</h2><h3 id=\"健康指标\">健康指标</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>计算方法</th>\n<th>健康阈值</th>\n<th>告警阈值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>通过率</td>\n<td>通过数 / 总数 × 100%</td>\n<td>&gt; 98%</td>\n<td>&lt; 95%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Flaky 率</td>\n<td>重试后通过数 / 总数 × 100%</td>\n<td>&lt; 3%</td>\n<td>&gt; 5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平均执行时间</td>\n<td>总时间 / 测试数</td>\n<td>&lt; 30s/测试</td>\n<td>&gt; 60s/测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P95 执行时间</td>\n<td>第 95 百分位测试耗时</td>\n<td>&lt; 60s</td>\n<td>&gt; 120s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>套件总时间</td>\n<td>从启动到报告完成</td>\n<td>&lt; CI 预算</td>\n<td>&gt; 2× 预算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"趋势指标\">趋势指标</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>质量趋势指数</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>本周通过率</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>上周通过率</mtext></mrow><mtext>上周通过率</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{质量趋势指数} = \\frac{\\text{本周通过率} - \\text{上周通过率}}{\\text{上周通过率}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">质量趋势指数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">上周通过率</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">本周通过率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">上周通过率</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>正值表示改善，负值表示退化。连续两周负值应触发审查。</p>\n<h3 id=\"效率指标\">效率指标</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>优化方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Bug 发现率</td>\n<td>E2E 发现的真实 Bug 数 / 总运行次数</td>\n<td>提升用例质量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>误报率</td>\n<td>Flaky 失败 / 总失败</td>\n<td>降低 Flaky</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反馈时间</td>\n<td>从推送到获得结果的时间</td>\n<td>加速 CI 流水线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ROI</td>\n<td>避免的生产事故成本 / 测试维护成本</td>\n<td>聚焦高价值场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"失败分析\">失败分析</h2><h3 id=\"失败分类框架\">失败分类框架</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[测试失败] --&gt; B{重试后?}&#10;    B --&gt;|通过| C[Flaky 失败]&#10;    B --&gt;|仍失败| D{近期代码变更?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[回归 Bug]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F{环境异常?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[环境问题]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[测试本身问题]&#10;    C --&gt; I[进入 Flaky 治理]&#10;    E --&gt; J[生成 Bug Report]&#10;    G --&gt; K[环境修复]&#10;    H --&gt; L[测试维护]\">graph TD\n    A[测试失败] --&gt; B{重试后?}\n    B --&gt;|通过| C[Flaky 失败]\n    B --&gt;|仍失败| D{近期代码变更?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[回归 Bug]\n    D --&gt;|否| F{环境异常?}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[环境问题]\n    F --&gt;|否| H[测试本身问题]\n    C --&gt; I[进入 Flaky 治理]\n    E --&gt; J[生成 Bug Report]\n    G --&gt; K[环境修复]\n    H --&gt; L[测试维护]</pre><h3 id=\"trace-viewer-分析\">Trace Viewer 分析</h3><p>Playwright Trace Viewer 是失败分析的核心工具：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>面板</th>\n<th>提供信息</th>\n<th>分析价值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Actions</td>\n<td>每步操作的时间线</td>\n<td>定位卡在哪一步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Console</td>\n<td>浏览器控制台日志</td>\n<td>前端错误追踪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Network</td>\n<td>所有网络请求和响应</td>\n<td>API 异常识别</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Source</td>\n<td>测试源码当前位置</td>\n<td>逻辑对比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Snapshot</td>\n<td>每步操作时的 DOM 快照</td>\n<td>视觉状态确认</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"自动失败归因\">自动失败归因</h3><p>构建自动归因系统，将失败与代码变更关联：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 自动分析脚本伪代码&#10;interface FailureAnalysis {&#10;  testName: string;&#10;  category: &#39;regression&#39; | &#39;flaky&#39; | &#39;environment&#39; | &#39;test-issue&#39;;&#10;  confidence: number;&#10;  relatedCommit?: string;&#10;  suggestedAction: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function analyzeFailure(result: TestResult, gitLog: Commit[]): FailureAnalysis {&#10;  if (result.retriesPass &gt; 0) {&#10;    return { category: &#39;flaky&#39;, suggestedAction: &#39;进入 Flaky 治理队列&#39; };&#10;  }&#10;  const relatedChange = findRelatedCommit(result.failedFile, gitLog);&#10;  if (relatedChange) {&#10;    return { category: &#39;regression&#39;, relatedCommit: relatedChange.sha };&#10;  }&#10;  return { category: &#39;test-issue&#39;, suggestedAction: &#39;审查测试逻辑&#39; };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 自动分析脚本伪代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FailureAnalysis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  testName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  category</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'regression'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'flaky'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'environment'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'test-issue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  confidence</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  relatedCommit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  suggestedAction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> analyzeFailure</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TestResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">gitLog</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Commit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FailureAnalysis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (result.retriesPass </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { category: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'flaky'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, suggestedAction: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'进入 Flaky 治理队列'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> relatedChange</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> findRelatedCommit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result.failedFile, gitLog);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (relatedChange) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { category: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'regression'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, relatedCommit: relatedChange.sha };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { category: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'test-issue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, suggestedAction: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'审查测试逻辑'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"仪表板设计\">仪表板设计</h2><h3 id=\"核心看板布局\">核心看板布局</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>区域</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>更新频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>顶部摘要</td>\n<td>今日通过率、Flaky 率、总耗时</td>\n<td>实时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>趋势图</td>\n<td>7 天/30 天通过率曲线</td>\n<td>每日</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Top Failures</td>\n<td>最频繁失败的 Top 10 测试</td>\n<td>每次运行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Slow Tests</td>\n<td>最慢的 Top 10 测试</td>\n<td>每日</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>覆盖地图</td>\n<td>各功能域的覆盖状态</td>\n<td>每周</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"告警规则\">告警规则</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>条件</th>\n<th>严重度</th>\n<th>通知渠道</th>\n<th>响应 SLA</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>通过率 &lt; 90%</td>\n<td>Critical</td>\n<td>Slack + 电话</td>\n<td>1 小时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通过率 &lt; 95%</td>\n<td>Warning</td>\n<td>Slack</td>\n<td>4 小时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新增 Flaky &gt; 5/天</td>\n<td>Warning</td>\n<td>Slack</td>\n<td>当日</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>套件时间 &gt; 2× 基线</td>\n<td>Info</td>\n<td>邮件</td>\n<td>本周</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"ci-平台集成\">CI 平台集成</h2><h3 id=\"pr-评论集成\">PR 评论集成</h3><p>在 PR 中自动评论测试结果摘要：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"- name: Comment PR with results&#10;  if: github.event_name == &#39;pull_request&#39;&#10;  uses: actions/github-script@v7&#10;  with:&#10;    script: |&#10;      const results = require(&#39;./results/results.json&#39;);&#10;      const summary = `&#10;      ## E2E 测试结果&#10;      - 通过: ${results.passed} | 失败: ${results.failed} | 跳过: ${results.skipped}&#10;      - 耗时: ${results.duration}s&#10;      ${results.failed &gt; 0 ? &#39;⚠️ [查看详情](&#39; + artifactUrl + &#39;)&#39; : &#39;✅ 全部通过&#39;}&#10;      `;&#10;      await github.rest.issues.createComment({&#10;        owner: context.repo.owner,&#10;        repo: context.repo.repo,&#10;        issue_number: context.issue.number,&#10;        body: summary,&#10;      });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Comment PR with results</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">github.event_name == 'pull_request'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/github-script@v7</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    script</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      const results = require('./results/results.json');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      const summary = `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      ## E2E 测试结果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      - 通过: ${results.passed} | 失败: ${results.failed} | 跳过: ${results.skipped}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      - 耗时: ${results.duration}s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      ${results.failed > 0 ? '⚠️ [查看详情](' + artifactUrl + ')' : '✅ 全部通过'}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      `;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      await github.rest.issues.createComment({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        owner: context.repo.owner,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        repo: context.repo.repo,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        issue_number: context.issue.number,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        body: summary,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      });</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"反模式\">反模式</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反模式</th>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>正确做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>只看通过/失败</td>\n<td>无法发现趋势性退化</td>\n<td>追踪趋势指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>报告没人看</td>\n<td>失去反馈循环</td>\n<td>推送到日常工作流（PR/Slack）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不区分 Flaky 和真实失败</td>\n<td>治理方向错误</td>\n<td>自动分类标记</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>只统计不行动</td>\n<td>数据变成噪音</td>\n<td>每个指标绑定明确的响应动作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>报告内容过多</td>\n<td>信息过载</td>\n<td>分层报告，按角色裁剪</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>测试报告的价值不在于数据量而在于可行动性——每个指标必须绑定明确的响应动作，每份报告必须推送到对应角色的日常工作流中。核心实践：多报告器并行产出、Trace Viewer 作为失败分析的第一站、自动失败归因减少人工分类、趋势告警发现渐进式退化。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>同章参考</strong>：<a href=\"ci-pipeline-integration\">CI 流水线集成</a> 产生报告分析所需的原始数据；<a href=\"shift-left-continuous-testing\">左移与持续测试</a> 利用报告洞察驱动测试策略优化。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"测试报告与分析","id":"测试报告与分析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"报告层级模型","id":"报告层级模型"},{"level":2,"text":"Playwright 内置报告","id":"playwright-内置报告"},{"level":3,"text":"报告器类型","id":"报告器类型"},{"level":3,"text":"多报告器并行配置","id":"多报告器并行配置"},{"level":3,"text":"HTML 报告内容","id":"html-报告内容"},{"level":2,"text":"关键度量指标","id":"关键度量指标"},{"level":3,"text":"健康指标","id":"健康指标"},{"level":3,"text":"趋势指标","id":"趋势指标"},{"level":3,"text":"效率指标","id":"效率指标"},{"level":2,"text":"失败分析","id":"失败分析"},{"level":3,"text":"失败分类框架","id":"失败分类框架"},{"level":3,"text":"Trace Viewer 分析","id":"trace-viewer-分析"},{"level":3,"text":"自动失败归因","id":"自动失败归因"},{"level":2,"text":"仪表板设计","id":"仪表板设计"},{"level":3,"text":"核心看板布局","id":"核心看板布局"},{"level":3,"text":"告警规则","id":"告警规则"},{"level":2,"text":"CI 平台集成","id":"ci-平台集成"},{"level":3,"text":"PR 评论集成","id":"pr-评论集成"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式","id":"反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"CI 流水线集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/e2e-test-automation/ci-integration/ci-pipeline-integration"},"next":{"title":"左移与持续测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/e2e-test-automation/ci-integration/shift-left-continuous-testing"}}